   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of the\nstate highway system as the \"Tec. Sgt. 5 Edward Enser Memorial Highway\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S6550",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6550-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §344-m, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6550\n\nSPONSOR: GALLIVAN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of\nthe state highway system as the \"Tec. Sgt. 5 Edward Enser Memorial High-\nway\"\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nDesignates the Portion of State route 75 from Langford Road south to\nShirley Road the Town of North Collins, county of Erie, as the \"Tec.\nSgt. 5 Edward Enser Memorial Highway\"\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1: Amends the highway law by adding a new section 344-m, which\nDesignates the Portion of State route 75 from Langford Road south to\nShirley Road the Town of North Collins, county of Erie, as the \"Tee.\nSgt. 5 Edward Enser Memorial Highway\n\nSection 2: States that the commissioner of transportation shall provide\nfor the installation and maintenance of adequate signing of the state\nhighway systems as designated pursuant to section 1 of this act. The\ndesignation will be for ceremonial purposes only, and the official name\nof the bridge will not be changed as a result of this act.\n\nSection 3: Provides the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nTec Sgt. 5 Edward Enser served his country in the US Army during the\nSecond World War, and received the Bronze Star, Purple Heart, Presiden-\ntial Unit Citation, Croix de Guerre with Palm Orders, Distinguished Unit\nBadge, European African Middle Eastern Service Medal. w/ 8 Battle Stars,\nArmy of Occupation Germany, Rhine, Danube Campaign Medals, WWII Victory\nMedal, and Good Conduct Medal.\n\nThis legislation is to pay tribute to Tec Sgt 5 Edward Enser's honorable\nand heroic service.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
